# Share-card tooling: fonts are downloaded on first run (open-licensed, so
# there is no reason to carry 1 MB of TTFs in git), and the background panels
# are image-model output kept local. The generated cards in assets/share/ ARE
# committed — they are what the live site serves.
tools/.fonts/
tools/panels/*.png
